⚙️ Software Setup (Arduino IDE)
Partition Scheme: Select Tools > Partition Scheme > Huge APP (3MB No OTA/1MB SPIFFS).

SD Card: Format and place an audio file named exactly Alerta.wav formatted as 8-bit, Mono PCM.

Credentials: Update your Wi-Fi SSID, password, Telegram Bot Token, and Chat ID in the source code prior to uploading.
